request.description:
Returns the list of sellers in this order. Use this as a lightweight call to populate the company selector before calling `request-wolt-delivery`.

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Store A",
      "store_code": "STA",
      "wolt_status": null,
      "has_active_items": true
    }
  ]
}
```

`wolt_status` — `null` (not requested), `pending`, `delivering`, `delivered`, `canceled`.
`has_active_items` — `false` if all items for this seller are canceled.

